{"id": "unknown-2026-10-03-004", "date": "2026-10-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 40, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["increase", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "What drove India's manufacturing PMI to a 7-month high in September?", "content": "India’s manufacturing PMI rose to 55.1 in September from 52.8 in August, marking a seven-month high.\nStronger domestic and export demand, including for textiles, boosted new orders and output, while hiring and inventory accumulation resumed. \nBusiness confidence reached a four-month high, although input and selling price pressures also increased.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/what-drove-india-s-manufacturing-pmi-to-a-7-month-high-in-september--313916-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-03-005", "date": "2026-10-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 40, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["growth", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s growth resilience faces energy & capital flow pressures: S&P", "content": "India needs to revive private investment, strengthen infrastructure and address energy and financial bottlenecks to sustain growth, according to S&P Global and Crisil. \nTheir report estimated that achieving developed-economy status by 2047 required annual GDP growth of roughly 7.8 per cent. \nDespite strong economic buffers, higher oil prices and rainfall shortfalls posed challenges to growth. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-growth-resilience-faces-energy-capital-flow-pressures-s-p-313884-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
